{'symbol': 'AAL', 'date': '2022-07-11 17:00:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN AIRLINES PUBLISHES 2021 ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE REPORT', 'text': "FORT WORTH, TEXAS, JULY 11, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- AMERICAN AIRLINES GROUP INC. (NASDAQ: AAL) ISSUED ITS 2021 ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) REPORT TODAY, PROVIDING UPDATES ON THE COMPANY'S STRATEGY AND PROGRESS ACROSS KEY ISSUES OVER THE YEAR. THE REPORT AFFIRMS AMERICAN'S FOCUS ON THE ISSUES MOST IMPORTANT TO ITS BUSINESS AND STAKEHOLDERS, INCLUDING CLIMATE CHANGE; DIVERSITY, EQUITY AND INCLUSION (DEI); CUSTOMER AND TEAM MEMBER SAFETY; AND CUSTOMER SERVICE."}